{"id":"b0e5598f570a6835","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic.md","title":"Characteristic Formulas and Closure of Window Tableaux","display":"df-gl-tableau-characteristic — Characteristic Formulas and Closure of Window Tableaux","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic","aliases":["89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic"],"display":"df-gl-tableau-characteristic — Characteristic Formulas and Closure of Window Tableaux","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tableau]]","[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-tableau-characteristic — Characteristic Formulas and Closure of Window Tableaux"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69407d4d0243b2de\" href=\"?note=69407d4d0243b2de\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau\">89-df-gl-tableau</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(T\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)\">\\(b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)\\)</span> 是其分支记录。</li>\n<li>有限合取与析取按序列折叠，空合取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>，空析取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\">\\(\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\land\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\Diamond\\chi(U)\\mid U\\in\\mathcal U\\rangle,\\\\\n\\chi(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle\\chi(b)\\mid b\\in T\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bot\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\lor\n\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ (A,\\neg A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma))\\lor\n\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal U)\\ \\mathsf{Cl}(U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\ \\mathsf{Cl}(b),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Open}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(T),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Open}(b)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(b).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi(b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\land\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\Diamond\\chi(U)\\mid U\\in\\mathcal U\\rangle,\\\\\n\\chi(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle\\chi(b)\\mid b\\in T\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(b)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bot\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\lor\n\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ (A,\\neg A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma))\\lor\n\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal U)\\ \\mathsf{Cl}(U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\ \\mathsf{Cl}(b),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Open}(T)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(T),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Open}(b)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(b).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.141、143–144。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>为精确表达折叠，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle f(x)\\mid x\\in s\\rangle\">\\(\\langle f(x)\\mid x\\in s\\rangle\\)</span> 沿有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的位置顺序取值，不沿集合任意排列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 只记录处理状态，不改变特征公式。</p>\n<p>两组互递归定义均按窗口深度成立：分支只调用其窗口树，而窗口树度数小于当前树。只要某窗口内的树闭合，其所在外层分支即闭合；全部外层分支闭合才是整树闭合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau","status":"resolved","id":"69407d4d0243b2de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限合取与析取按序列折叠，空合取为 $\\top$，空析取为 $\\bot$，see [[89-df-modal-sequent]]。$\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\in\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"b=(\\Gamma,E,\\mathcal U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}characteristic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\chi(b)&\\coloneqq\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\land\n\\bigwedge\\langle\\Diamond\\chi(U)\\mid U\\in\\mathcal U\\rangle,\\\\\n\\chi(T)&\\coloneqq\\bigvee\\langle\\chi(b)\\mid b\\in T\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(b)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bot\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma)\\lor\n\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ (A,\\neg A\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma))\\lor\n\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal U)\\ \\mathsf{Cl}(U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cl}(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\ \\mathsf{Cl}(b),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Open}(T)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(T),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Open}(b)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathsf{Cl}(b).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle f(x)\\mid x\\in s\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false}],"bytes":2015,"backlinks":[{"id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["69407d4d0243b2de","0e77586c4dc7e03a","ca21b68a25f1afc2"]}